  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together pepper sauce, soy sauce, peanut butter, honey, garlic, and ginger.",
    "Add chicken to the bowl and marinate for at least 30 minutes, or up to 2 hours in the refrigerator.",
    "Thread chicken onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Brush skewers with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.",
    "Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes, or until chicken is cooked through.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with chopped cilantro or scallions if desired."
